    "details": "https://grafana.com/security/security-advisories/cve-2026-21722 reports:\n\n> Public dashboards with annotations enabled did not limit their\n> annotation timerange to the locked timerange of the public dashboard.\n> This means one could read the entire history of annotations visible on\n> the specific dashboard, even those outside the locked timerange. This\n> did not leak any annotations that would not otherwise be visible on\n> the public dashboard.\n",
